WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:03.921
SAM WILSON
Today we're here to honor the legacy.

00:00:05.844 --> 00:00:07.424
Symbols...

00:00:08.571 --> 00:00:11.386
...are nothing without the women
and men that give them meaning.

00:00:12.383 --> 00:00:14.583
We need new heroes.

00:00:17.748 --> 00:00:19.269
(in all the right ways.)

00:00:15.201 --> 00:00:17.748
(The Falcon and the Winter Solider
is relevant and gripping)

00:00:19.693 --> 00:00:23.164
(Marvel has brought feature film
caliber storytelling to Disney+.)

00:00:23.164 --> 00:00:24.209
ZEMO
Superheroes...

00:00:25.037 --> 00:00:26.652
cannot be allowed to exist.

